+
+    Chart titles, panel names and build labels come from benchmark metadata, --label and the command line, so any of them
+    may hold markup: escaped here, at the one point where the text enters the document, and nowhere else, so nothing is
+    escaped twice. Everything else (accented letters, CJK, emoji) is left as it is: the file is UTF-8."""
+    return escape(NOT_XML.sub("", str(value)))
+
+
